        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="azd provisions infra/azd.bicep (resource group + the same main.bicep every other path uses) and runs two hooks. Configuration comes from the azd environment; see docs/12 for every variable." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#605E5C;">
