        <mxCell id="same" value="&lt;b&gt;Same resources, three ways.&lt;/b&gt; azd up, infra/deploy.ps1 and the manual Portal path (docs/03b) all deploy main.bicep's resources with the same names, so every later doc applies unchanged. azd is the fast path; deploy.ps1 suits an existing resource group; 03b suits customers who cannot run IaC." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B7791F;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=4;spacing=10;">
